<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/custom.css" />
  <title>ACH Direct Debit — Sandbox Testing</title>
  <style>
    .page-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #1a1a1a; }
    .page-header .badge-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .page-header p { color: #666; margin: 0; }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      color: #0070ba; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .info-banner {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #e3f2fd;
      border: 1px solid #90caf9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.88em;
      color: #0d47a1;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .info-banner strong { color: #0a2d6e; }
    .info-banner ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; }
    .info-banner ul li { margin-bottom: 3px; }

    .warning-banner {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #fff8e1;
      border: 1px solid #ffe082;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      color: #795548;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .warning-banner strong { color: #5d4037; }

    .test-section {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .test-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      font-size: 1.05em;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #0070ba;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .test-section p { color: #555; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 10px 0 16px; }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px 20px;
    }
    .form-grid.three-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .form-grid, .form-grid.three-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .form-group.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .form-group label { font-size: 0.82em; font-weight: 600; color: #444; }
    .form-group input, .form-group select {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #0070ba;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,112,186,0.15);
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.92em;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: #0070ba; color: #fff; margin-top: 16px; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #005ea6; }
    .btn-primary:disabled { background: #aaa; cursor: not-allowed; }

    .status-area {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.88em;
      display: none;
    }
    .status-area.info    { background: #e8f4fd; border: 1px solid #bee3f8; color: #2b6cb0; display: block; }
    .status-area.success { background: #f0fff4; border: 1px solid #9ae6b4; color: #276749; display: block; }
    .status-area.error   { background: #fff5f5; border: 1px solid #feb2b2; color: #c53030; display: block; }

    .response-panel { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 16px; display: none; }
    .response-panel h3 { margin: 0; padding: 12px 18px; background: #f8f9fa; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; font-size: 0.9em; color: #333; }
    .response-panel pre {
      margin: 0; padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #1e1e1e; color: #d4d4d4;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;
      overflow: auto; max-height: 360px;
    }

    .flow-steps {
      counter-reset: step;
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
    .flow-steps li {
      counter-increment: step;
      position: relative;
      padding: 8px 8px 8px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #444;
    }
    .flow-steps li::before {
      content: counter(step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: #0070ba;
      color: #fff;
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    }

    .sec-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85em; margin-top: 8px; }
    .sec-table th { background: #f0f4fa; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; color: #444; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 2px solid #dde3ed; }
    .sec-table td { padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; color: #555; vertical-align: top; }
    .sec-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    code { background: #eef; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.9em; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Dashboard</a>

    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="sdk-badge rest-api">⚠ Direct REST API</span>
        <span class="sdk-badge server-sdk">✓ Server SDK</span>
      </div>
      <h1>ACH Direct Debit</h1>
      <p>Merchant-collected bank account details passed via <code>payment_source.bank.ach_debit</code> on capture. No JS SDK required.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="info-banner">
      <strong>Integration path:</strong> Marketplace &amp; Platforms (Managed Path) — limited release.
      <ul>
        <li>Merchant collects routing + account number directly; passes them server-side to PayPal</li>
        <li><code>attributes.verification.external.status: "VERIFIED"</code> — merchant asserts they verified the account externally</li>
        <li>Capture status is <code>PENDING</code> initially; funds settle in ~5 calendar days</li>
        <li>Requires PayPal approval — contact your CSM or Sales before going live</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="warning-banner">
      <strong>Sandbox sandbox:</strong> Use test routing number <code>021000021</code> (Chase) and any 10-digit account number.
      ACH approval is required on your sandbox account — if capture returns a permission error, ACH has not been provisioned for this account.
    </div>

    <!-- Flow overview -->
    <div class="test-section">
      <h2>Integration Flow</h2>
      <p>Two API calls: create order (no payment_source), then capture with bank details.</p>
      <ol class="flow-steps">
        <li>Merchant UI collects buyer's bank routing number, account number, account type, and authorization</li>
        <li><code>POST /v2/checkout/orders</code> — create order with amount only (no payment_source yet)</li>
        <li><code>POST /v2/checkout/orders/:id/capture</code> — send <code>payment_source.bank.ach_debit</code> with bank details</li>
        <li>Response status is <code>PENDING</code> — listen for <code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED</code> webhook to confirm settlement</li>
      </ol>

      <table class="sec-table">
        <thead><tr><th>SEC Code</th><th>Use Case</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>WEB</code></td><td>Online-initiated</td><td>Default for e-commerce; requires digital authorization proof</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>TEL</code></td><td>Phone-authorized</td><td>Requires oral or written authorization before settlement</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>CCD</code></td><td>Business accounts</td><td>Set <code>ownership_type: BUSINESS</code>; 2-day unauthorized window</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>PPD</code></td><td>Standing authorizations</td><td>Consumer accounts; recurring or single entry</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 1: Create Order -->
    <div class="test-section">
      <h2>Step 1 — Create Order</h2>
      <p>Creates a standard order with <code>intent: CAPTURE</code> and amount. No bank details yet.</p>

      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="amount">Amount (USD)</label>
          <input type="number" id="amount" value="50.00" step="0.01" min="0.01" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="create-btn">Create Order</button>

      <div id="create-status" class="status-area"></div>
      <div id="create-response" class="response-panel">
        <h3>Create Order Response</h3>
        <pre id="create-response-content"></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Capture with ACH -->
    <div class="test-section">
      <h2>Step 2 — Capture with Bank Details</h2>
      <p>
        Sends <code>payment_source.bank.ach_debit</code> with the bank account details.
        Order ID is auto-filled from Step 1.
      </p>

      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="order-id">Order ID</label>
          <input type="text" id="order-id" placeholder="Auto-filled from Step 1" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="account-holder">Account Holder Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="account-holder" value="Jane Doe" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="routing-number">Routing Number</label>
          <input type="text" id="routing-number" value="021000021" maxlength="9" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="account-number">Account Number</label>
          <input type="text" id="account-number" value="1234567890" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="account-type">Account Type</label>
          <select id="account-type">
            <option value="CHECKING">CHECKING</option>
            <option value="SAVINGS">SAVINGS</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="ownership-type">Ownership Type</label>
          <select id="ownership-type">
            <option value="PERSONAL">PERSONAL</option>
            <option value="BUSINESS">BUSINESS</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="sec-code">SEC Code</label>
          <select id="sec-code">
            <option value="WEB">WEB — Online</option>
            <option value="TEL">TEL — Phone</option>
            <option value="CCD">CCD — Business</option>
            <option value="PPD">PPD — Standing auth</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <details style="margin-top:16px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer; font-size:0.88em; color:#555; font-weight:600;">Billing Address (optional)</summary>
        <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div class="form-group full">
            <label for="addr-line1">Address Line 1</label>
            <input type="text" id="addr-line1" value="2211 N First Street" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="addr-city">City</label>
            <input type="text" id="addr-city" value="San Jose" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="addr-state">State</label>
            <input type="text" id="addr-state" value="CA" maxlength="2" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="addr-zip">Postal Code</label>
            <input type="text" id="addr-zip" value="95131" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="addr-country">Country</label>
            <input type="text" id="addr-country" value="US" maxlength="2" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="capture-btn">Capture with ACH</button>

      <div id="capture-status" class="status-area"></div>
      <div id="capture-response" class="response-panel">
        <h3>Capture Response</h3>
        <pre id="capture-response-content"></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Webhooks reference -->
    <div class="test-section">
      <h2>Expected Webhooks</h2>
      <p>ACH captures start as <code>PENDING</code> and settle asynchronously. Configure at <a href="/webhook-testing" target="_blank">Webhook Dashboard</a>.</p>
      <ul style="font-size:0.9em; color:#555; padding-left:20px;">
        <li><code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.PENDING</code> — initial state after capture; funds in transit (~5 days)</li>
        <li><code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED</code> — settlement confirmed; safe to fulfill the order</li>
        <li><code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.DENIED</code> — payment rejected by the bank</li>
        <li><code>PAYMENT.CAPTURE.REVERSED</code> — ACH return (NSF, account closed, unauthorized)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>

  <script src="/ach.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
